{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-06-14 11:08:00', 'title': 'IBM QUANTUM COMPUTER DEMONSTRATES NEXT STEP TOWARDS MOVING BEYOND CLASSICAL SUPERCOMPUTING', 'text': 'NEW RESEARCH PUBLISHED IN NATURE SHOWS EVIDENCE OF QUANTUM UTILITY BACKED BY THIS EVIDENCE, IBM TO UPGRADE ITS FULL FLEET OF IBM QUANTUM SYSTEMS TO LARGE-SCALE QUANTUM PROCESSORS OVER 100+\xa0QUBITS TOP RESEARCH INSTITUTIONS AND INDUSTRY LEADERS INCLUDING BOEING,\xa0BOSCH, CLEVELAND CLINIC, CERN, DESY, E.ON, EXXONMOBIL, MODERNA, OAK RIDGE NATIONAL LAB, THE UNIVERSITY OF CHICAGO, RIKEN, AND WELLS FARGO FORM WORKING GROUPS TO PURSUE NEAR-TERM QUANTUM VALUE ARMONK, N.Y. , JUNE 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW BREAKTHROUGH, PUBLISHED ON THE COVER OF THE SCIENTIFIC JOURNAL\xa0NATURE, DEMONSTRATING FOR THE FIRST TIME THAT QUANTUM COMPUTERS CAN PRODUCE ACCURATE RESULTS AT A SCALE OF 100+ QUBITS REACHING BEYOND LEADING CLASSICAL APPROACHES.'}